		(uuid "9eedbe52-46c9-4065-816c-1cfb5c385cb4")
	)
	(text_box "Mettre diode TVS entre ligne protegée et ground a l'endoirt ou je branche, entre USBC et gnd et entre la sortie et gnd\naussi entre D+ D- et gnd\nPeut utiliser une diode à souder un peu partout, pas prendre bidirectionnel\nprendre 0.5V au dessus du signal utile"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 129.54 170.18 0)
		(size 45.72 19.0501)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a5e403fd-25ea-498a-88c5-46d3405bcfdd")
	)
	(text_box "R14 is a thermistor to be placed as close to the battery as possible. The Seiko BMS integrated in our battery only handles the electric protection (charge, discharge) and not the temperature. Via TS, the IC progressively adjusts the charging profile according to the temperature to preserve the battery (JEITA). Its value at 25°C should be of 10kOhm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 38.61 0)
		(size 38.1 22.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c6e3b142-60a9-4877-a1b1-fac0922d59c3")
	)
	(text_box "USB-C CONNECTOR\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 124.46 0)
		(size 97.79 68.58)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c8af01fa-6292-4fd6-9acc-319a4d8825fd")
	)
	(text_box "The USB connector we use has to be compatible with the IC used to manage the battery. This is why we chose a USB-C 2.0 connector. The wiring is done to turn it into a \"dumb\" charger, providing the IC with the information of how much current and voltage it can pull, charging the battery and powering the system if a cable is connected, ignoring most of its data transfer abilities.\nSBU1/2 left floating on purpose."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 72.39 172.72 0)
		(size 53.34 20.3053)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d425b8e8-f8b9-4d84-b1ad-bbbe188df713")
	)
